m:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public enum Status {\r\n    READY(&quot;대기&quot;), RUNNING(&quot;실행 중&quot;), DONE(&quot;완료&quot;);\r\n\r\n    private final String label;\r\n    Status(String label) { this.label = label; }\r\n    public String getLabel() { return label; }\r\n}\r\n\r\nStatus s = Status.valueOf(&quot;READY&quot;);\r\nswitch (s) {\r\n    case READY -&gt; start();\r\n    case DONE  -&gt; close();\r\n    default    -&gt; { }\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Java enum 은 클래스 — 필드 · 생성자 · 메서드를 가질 수 있다</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 열거형 (Enum)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/type-combination/enum","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"type-combination","title":"타입 조합 · 제한","path":"it/syntax/java/type-combination"}],"hasImage":false}